title: "Walking Memories"
abstract: >-
  Open-source artbook retracing the digital footprints of an exiled wanderer's
  eight-year odyssey: 263 photographs, a blockchain archive, and an asylum file,
  told in parallel across his Belgian pixels. Web book, print layout and PDF pipeline.
